sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SCH as Python Scheduler
    participant NC as Python News Service
    participant CFG as Approved Source Registry
    participant RSS as RSS Adapter
    participant FETCH as Safe Fetcher
    participant EXT as External Source
    participant READ as Readability Extractor
    participant GATE as Content Quality Gate
    participant AGT as NewsExtractionAgent
    participant AI as Internal AI Adapter
    participant TAG as News Tagger
    participant SENT as Sentiment Orchestrator
    participant DB as Python-owned PostgreSQL/Object Storage

    SCH->>NC: collect_all(since checkpoint)
    NC->>CFG: active allowlisted sources
    CFG-->>NC: RSS feeds and article-origin rules

    alt RSS source
        NC->>RSS: collect metadata with bounded request
        RSS->>EXT: GET RSS
        EXT-->>RSS: RSS XML
        RSS-->>NC: title, URL, summary, published_at
    else approved article URL
        NC->>FETCH: fetch URL
        FETCH->>FETCH: HTTPS, DNS/IP, redirect, size and type guards
        FETCH->>EXT: GET article
        EXT-->>FETCH: HTML
        FETCH->>READ: sanitize then deterministic extraction
        READ-->>NC: document_id, canonical text, content_hash, diagnostics
    end

    NC->>GATE: validate text/content/provenance quality
    alt quality passes
        GATE-->>NC: normalized document
    else quality fails
        GATE-->>NC: persisted extraction failure reference
        NC->>AGT: run with document_id and failure reference
        AGT->>AGT: typed tools read sanitized HTML, diagnostics and schema
        AGT->>AI: structured extraction request only
        AI-->>AGT: proposed structured document
        AGT->>GATE: schema + quality + provenance validation
        alt fallback valid
            GATE-->>NC: recovered normalized document
        else fallback invalid
            GATE-->>NC: terminal extraction failure, do not fabricate content
        end
    end

    NC->>DB: UPSERT NewsDocument by url_hash/content_hash
    NC->>TAG: structured tags with model/prompt version
    TAG-->>NC: validated tags and evidence spans
    NC->>DB: UPSERT NewsTags by content/model/prompt hash
    NC->>SENT: classify canonical text
    alt model output valid
        SENT-->>NC: label, score, model_version
        NC->>DB: UPSERT SentimentResult
    else model unavailable or invalid
        NC->>DB: persist failed analysis, sentiment remains null/unavailable
    end

    Note over AGT,AI: Agent has no fetch, arbitrary HTTP, SQL or direct DB-write tool.
